.Dd @MAN_DATE@
.Dt GLIFISTORE 7
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm glifistore
.Nd GlifiStore key-value store overview
.Sh DESCRIPTION
GlifiStore is a C++23 key-value store with a durable persistence format (v1),
a wire protocol (v2), and a network daemon.
Version
.Sy @PROJECT_VERSION@
ships the following installed command-line programs.
.Pp
The sole
.Nm glifistored
runtime uses paired Reader/Writer shard pairs
.Pq see ADR 0031 .
Embedded
.Nm Store::open
defaults to the same paired concurrency model.
.Ss Network daemon
.Bl -tag -width "glifistored" -compact
.It Xr glifistored 8
TCP/TLS/UDS daemon around an embedded Store.
.El
.Ss Offline maintenance
Stop writers before using offline tools that take the exclusive Store directory
lock.
.Bl -tag -width "glifistore_inspect_segment" -compact
.It Xr glifistore_inspect_segment 1
Read-only validation of one Segment file.
.It Xr glifistore_verify_store 1
Read-only structural validation of a data directory.
.It Xr glifistore_backup_store 1
Offline verified backup or restore between directories.
.It Xr glifistore_migrate_store 1
Offline Worker reshard / logical rewrite.
.It Xr glifistore_repair_store 1
Offline catalog repair into an empty workspace.
.It Xr glifistore_rebuild_index 1
Durable v1 Index rebuild is refused; documents the operator path.
.El
.Ss Sample binary
.Bl -tag -width "glifistore_demo" -compact
.It Xr glifistore_demo 1
Prints topology bootstrap diagnostics; not an operator tool.
.El
.Sh COMMON CLI CONTRACT
Unless a page says otherwise:
.Bl -bullet -compact
.It
.Fl h , Fl Fl help
prints help on standard output and exits 0.
.It
.Fl V , Fl Fl version
prints the program name and GlifiStore version.
.It
Long options accept
.Cm --option value
and
.Cm --option=value .
.It
.Cm --
ends option parsing.
.It
Invalid usage exits 2; runtime/I/O failures exit 1; success exits 0.
.It
Byte-size values accept bytes or
.Cm KB , KiB , MB , MiB , GB ,
and
.Cm GiB
suffixes (decimal and binary suffixes are distinct).
.El
.Sh DURABILITY HONESTY
Durable modes use synchronous write-through semantics as documented for the
selected
.Cm --storage-mode .
Physical power-loss certification (E3/E4) and zero-fence hot backup are not
implied by installing these manuals.
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width "/usr/local/share/GlifiStore" -compact
.It Pa share/GlifiStore
Installed
.Pa LICENSE , NOTICE , VERSION ,
and
.Pa THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
.Pq under the configured CMAKE_INSTALL_DATADIR .
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr glifistored 8 ,
.Xr glifistore_verify_store 1 ,
.Xr glifistore_backup_store 1
.Pp
Project documentation (source tree):
.Pa docs/cli.md ,
.Pa docs/operations/durable-tcp-daemon.md ,
.Pa docs/architecture/backup-restore.md .
.Sh AUTHORS
GlifiStore contributors.
.Sh BUGS
Report issues at
.Lk https://github.com/gpicchiarelli/GlifiStore .
